name: extra-t256-fanin
spec: 4
expect: bash
=== dot ===
digraph { a [shape=note label="t256:AAAAAAACaGk"]; b [shape=box label="printf bye"]; join [gl_role=op label="cat"]; a -> join; b -> join; }
=== modl ===
a hex t256:AAAAAAACaGk
b square printf bye
join square cat #gl role=op
a -> join
b -> join
=== bash ===
command -v t256 >/dev/null || { echo "gripeline: t256 not found" >&2; exit 127; }
cat <(t256 load AAAAAAACaGk) <(printf bye)
